# Declared exceptions for bar-check, one per line:
#   <category> <path-glob> [<substring>]
# Categories: suppression, test-deleted, test-skipped, assertion-removed,
# threshold-lowered, or * for any. Write the reason above the entry — a '#'
# only opens a comment as a line's first character, so the substring column
# can hold '# noqa' and its kin.

# bar-check's own action quotes every pattern it detects, in the detector, in
# its fixtures and in its README examples, so it reports itself without this.
# Named per category rather than '*': bar-check must still catch its own tests
# being deleted, moved out or hollowed out.
suppression actions/bar-check/*
test-skipped actions/bar-check/*
suppression README.md
test-skipped README.md
